From: Arnaud Le Blanc <arnaud.lb@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 20:09:54 +0200
Subject: Avoid state corruption via bailout

Minimal mitigation for EOL version.

Fix GHSA-w8hw-w9fx-j79w (CVE-2026-109618)
Fix GHSA-6wmf-4rv5-p3rp (CVE-2026-109619)

Backported from the PHP 7.4 version:
- shutdown_executor() frees the object store before the error handlers,
  so the fast shutdown resets are done just before
  zend_objects_store_free_object_storage().
- "|| 1" instead of "|| true" in the session upload progress callback
  (no stdbool.h).
- The max_multipart_body_parts hunk of the 7.4 patch is left out, the
  code is already there.

Co-authored-by: Ilija Tovilo <ilija.tovilo@me.com>
